<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-DM Management begun as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-DM Management begun as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read analyst Peter Schaeffer said he started coverage of DM Management Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>&quot;Top-line growth, exclusive of acquisitions or extended product offerings, should approximate 25 percent, while the earnings growth rate should average 25 to 35 percent over the next five years,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Shares in the direct marketer of womens' apparel closed Tuesday in over-the-counter trading at 9-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
